			"notes": "**New**\n- Module Wheel: hold a key and let go over a module to toggle it. Right-click and drag modules to rearrange them.\n- JJ’s theme look for the tablist\n- Unobtrusive: eat bob speed and height settings\n\n**Changed**\n- Pearls: with a full inventory, slot 9 is dropped onto the trapdoor to make room and picked back up after\n- Pearls: free look leaves you looking where you were\n- Auto fit sets the scale once instead of adjusting it over time\n- Selected theme outline is thicker and even\n- Sign to Item Frame is much faster\n- Custom Shape starts as a square\n- Crosshair preview hides instantly when you open a container\n\n**Fixed**\n- Fixed Tablist, Incognito and crosshair preview incompatibility with Exordium\n- Friends not coloured in the tab list\n- Custom Shape being invisible\n- Line through slider handles\n- Module columns staying low after searching\n- Container previews lost after rejoining\n- Tablist FPS drop"
