			"notes": "**New**\n- JJ’s theme: minimalist Meteor theme\n- Themes and Fonts tabs in Meteor\n- Module list scale, auto fit and column stacking\n- Resizable module columns\n- Chat pinning\n- Lookup: using 2b2t.vc API\n- Pearls: automatic chamber finding, throws a pearl in the chamber for you\n\n**Changed**\n- Encounters is now always on, with its settings in the Control Panel\n- Pearl pull message is now set per pearlbot\n- Unread chats go to the top\n- Typing in the Control Panel blocks movement\n- Chat presets removed\n\n**Fixed**\n- 2b2t detection through ZenithProxy\n- Via Recipe Fix\n- Chat messages containing %"
